      "html": "<div class=\"form\"><div class=\"form-h\">PREFECTURE · SCIENTIFIC ADVISORY BOARD</div><p>The board has considered whether the retention of clinical state captures at the proposed fidelity could have physical effects beyond those of conventional data storage. Absent any established mechanism by which stored information alters the probability of physical events, the board finds no basis for concern on physical grounds.</p><div class=\"sig\">signed: I. Arrighi</div></div>"
